<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of four-day Red Stipe Cup cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Berbice, Guyana: Match drawn. Guyana 281 and 263-2 (Clayton Lambert 159, N.Degroot 63). Trinidad and Tobago 413 (P.Simmons 116, D.Ganga 54, I.Bishop 50).</p>
<p>In St Catherine, Jamaica: Jamaica beat Leeward Islands by 251 runs. Jamaica 156 and 337-9 declared. Leeward Islands 145 and 97 (F.Rose 5-36).</p>
